Common Provider
    documentation "The student's special education service provider, either internal or external."
    shared string FirstName
        documentation "A name given to an individual at birth, baptism, or during another naming ceremony, or through legal change."
        is part of identity
    shared string LastSurname
        documentation "The name borne in common by members of a family."
        is part of identity
    bool PrimaryProvider
        documentation "Indicates that this provider was the Primary Service Provider."
        is optional
    shared string Code named ProviderCode
        documentation "A code assigned to the service provider."
        is optional
    descriptor ServiceProviderType
        documentation "Indicates service provider type, including specialist, internal staff, external staff, etc."
        is optional
    domain entity Staff
        documentation "The staff member providing the service, if applicable."
        is optional